{ SH4 Refined v3.37 INV337: the source of src\inventory_cave.inc (tools\inv337_gen.py translates it to MSVC inline
  asm). A copy of the cheat table's entry 7310 (ct7310_pockets_v6_marker.cea here, = the CT's script); the ONLY change
  is pk_gate (the attack bug: the weapon in hand and Playable Eileen's 80h..84h count on page 2). diff the two files.
  The [ENABLE] / [DISABLE] patch lists below are what Refined writes and restores (byte-checked against the exe).
  The text below is the cheat table's.

  SH4 (GOG PC) - Extend Toolbelt v6: 20 items on two pages, every item on exactly ONE page (no pins)  [v6]
  v6 + page-marker fix (src\research\hud\page_marker_fix.md, UNTESTED DRAFT): only pk_draw, pk_ind_x/pk_ind_dy
  defaults and pk_txt1/pk_txt2 differ from pockets_v6.cea.
  Game: SILENT HILL 4.exe (32-bit, base 400000, no relocations). Static RE only - see notes_v6.txt here and
  ..\research\inventory\inventory_re.txt. Replaces pockets_v5.cea (entry 7310). Do not enable both.

  How it works: the belt is page 1 (13D7B60, 10 entries). Page 2 ("Toolbelt 2") is chest entries 126..135
  (13D7FA0, 10 entries); the chest is bounded to 126. A flip rotates the pages. Game code only looks at page 1,
  so the hooks below make the game look at page 2 too where it matters. Page-2 entry i is used through the
  game's own routines with the index 88h+i (13D7B60 + 8 x (88h+i) = 13D7FA0 + 8 x i), never in bar/UI code.

  Switches: pk_pin   0 = no pins (default): the gun in hand and the medallion in use flip like any item
                     1 = v5 pins: the gun in Henry's hand and the Saint Medallion in use stay on the visible page
            pk_mel   1 = a melee weapon in hand may be on page 2 (default). 0 = it is pinned and R1/R2/R5 ignore
                     page 2 for melee (v4).
            pk_optc  1 = story/door/event code sees key items 3Ch..7Dh on page 2 (default).
            pk_ovf, pk_flip, pk_ind, pk_swap, pk_force: as v4/v5.
  Counters: pk_c3n page-2 story removals, pk_r5n re-equips from page 2, pk_gn rounds fired from a page-2 gun,
            pk_rln reloads done by R8 (gun or box on page 2), pk_mdn broken medallions removed from page 2.

  HOOKS (address - what - why)                                              new in v6 = *
  Storage, flips, overflow (v2..v4)
   4F4A09  HUD frame        flip requests (pk_swap), page-2 count, chest count clamp
   4F4A18  HUD draw         page marker 1/2
   5154A3  bar cursor       RIGHT past the last / LEFT past the first item flips (belt and chest player row)
   4F57B0  pockets full?    full only when both pages are full (overflow)
   4F5860  insert position  moves one visible item to page 2 when page 1 is full (overflow)
   4F6300 4F6510 4F6610 4F6453 4F6DF0  chest sort/merge/recount/ammo/put-in bounded to 126 entries
  Story items on page 2 (v5 Option C)
   4F5AAE  H-C1 how many of X   + page 2 for 3Ch..7Dh (pk_optc) and *for the Saint Medallion 08
   5171E0  H-C2 has item        replaced: page 1 as the game, then page 2 for 3Ch..7Dh
   516EC5  H-C3 remove one by id  not on page 1: one off its page-2 entry (3Ch..7Dh),
                                *R4 and one round off a page-2 gun 10h/11h (fire 53DF90; a gun stays at 0)
  Weapon in hand on page 2
   4F69E0  R1 condition of id   page 2 for guns, melee (pk_mel), *and the medallion in use (ghost touch, break)
   4F6AE6  R2 wear id           page 2 for guns and melee (pk_mel), worn and broken by the game's own code
   5347BA  R5 room spawn        the equipped weapon is re-attached from page 2
  * 4F6020  R3 gun empty?       replaced: page 1, then page 2 (fire 53DF50)
  * 4F5F50  R6 can reload       replaced: gun and ammo may each be on either page (53DED0, 530090)
  * 53DED0  R7 auto reload      replaced: ammo looked up on page 1, then page 2, then 517000
  * 517000  R8 reload/combine   gun on page 1 + page-1 box: the game's code; otherwise done here the same way
                                (rounds merged, ammo switch, an empty box removed from its own page)
  Medallion in use on page 2
  * 4F6AC5  M2 wear medallion   in use on page 2: worn (and broken) by the game's own code with 88h+i
  * 4F5D20  M3 medallion off    replaced: also clears +7 on page 2
  * 4F5D0E  M4 use medallion    also clears +7 on page 2, so only one medallion is ever in use
  * 516FF2  M5 after wear       a broken medallion on page 2 is removed (medallion off, page 2 packed)
  * 516C97  M6 bar toggle       in use on page 2: skip the game's bar write for a slot it does not have
  Not hooked on purpose: 4F5D60 (slot of medallion in use) is only read by bar/chest UI code that needs a
  page-1 slot; it answers -1 when the medallion in use is on page 2 (no E marker, nothing else).
  Table entries: 955 No Bloody Key Curse (4F5AA6) and 2970 Unbreakable Weapons (4F5C69) keep working; this
  script never writes their bytes.
}
